    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1407">

                <pb facs="1367" n="1357" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1357"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">394A.1115/11–1849</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Taipei</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Macdonald</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-18T19:00:00-05:00">November 18,
                            1949—7 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>471. View issuance evac warnings Amcits Formosa and special concern for welfare
                    dependents, Dept unable justify travel additional <pb facs="1368" n="1358"
                        xml:id="pg1358"/> dependents Formosa at this time. Dept therefore refusing
                    passports all dependents, official and nonofficial, desiring proceed Formosa and
                    discouraging such travel persons already in possession passports.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
